{"vid":"4Sj2IHTeJwE","source":"4Sj2IHTeJwE.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.1,"txt":"[SARAH A. SOULE] Great ideas and great leaders are not formed all at once."},{"t":5.6,"txt":"They are built over time, piece by piece, like a mosaic."},{"t":11,"txt":"One piece from a classroom discussion, a moment of"},{"t":14.2,"txt":"disagreement that forces you to rethink your assumptions."},{"t":18.2,"txt":"Individually, each of these moments may feel small,"},{"t":21.9,"txt":"but over time they accumulate, they shape how you think,"},{"t":26,"txt":"how you decide, and ultimately how you will lead."},{"t":30.3,"txt":"What you have experienced here exists because others"},{"t":34.9,"txt":"invested in it before you."},{"t":38,"txt":"They contributed their time, their energy, their mentorship,"},{"t":42.3,"txt":"and their resources to sustain and strengthen the GSB because"},{"t":47.8,"txt":"leadership is not only about building something new,"},{"t":51.6,"txt":"it's about sustaining and strengthening what"},{"t":54.2,"txt":"is worth building on"},{"t":56.6,"txt":"The first century of the Graduate School of Business was"},{"t":59.9,"txt":"built by individuals who stepped into uncertainty with purpose,"},{"t":64.6,"txt":"and as a result, created, led, and sustained something so"},{"t":69,"txt":"much larger than themselves."},{"t":71.2,"txt":"They built the mosaic that you inherit today."},{"t":75.5,"txt":"Now you will add to it."},{"t":77.5,"txt":"Your path may not be linear, but you leave here with"},{"t":81.4,"txt":"the tools, the judgment, and the community to"},{"t":84.6,"txt":"navigate what lies ahead."},{"t":87.4,"txt":"Congratulations, Class of 2026."}],"words":[{"t":0.12,"w":"[SARAH"},{"t":0.12,"w":"A."},{"t":0.12,"w":"SOULE]"},{"t":0.12,"w":"Great"},{"t":0.12,"w":"ideas"},{"t":0.12,"w":"and"},{"t":0.12,"w":"great"},{"t":0.12,"w":"leaders"},{"t":0.12,"w":"are"},{"t":0.12,"w":"not"},{"t":0.12,"w":"formed"},{"t":0.12,"w":"all"},{"t":0.12,"w":"at"},{"t":0.12,"w":"once."},{